### quality-records.http
### API tests for quality records

### Base query (pagination)
# Get page 1 with 5 records per page
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records?page=1&limit=5

### Filter queries
# By client_ip
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records?client_ip=192.168.1.100

###
# By pcNum
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records?pcNum=PC-001

###
# By label (fuzzy search, e.g., labels containing "ng")
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records?label=ng

###
# By timestamp range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records?startTime=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endTime=2024-07-30T23:59:59Z

### Sort queries
# Sort by confidence ascending
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records?sortBy=confidence&sortOrder=ASC

###
# Sort by timestamp descending (default behavior)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records?sortBy=timestamp&sortOrder=DESC

### Combined query
# Get records for pcNum 'PC-002', filter by label 'ok', and sort by timestamp ascending
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records?pcNum=PC-002&label=ok&sortBy=timestamp&sortOrder=ASC 

###
# By second
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/by-second

###
# By second with pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/by-second?page=1&limit=60

###
# By second with include_image
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/by-second?page=1&limit=60&include_image=true

###
# By second with time range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/by-second?startTime=2025-06-08T00:00:00Z&endTime=2025-06-08T23:59:59Z

###
# By second with ip
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/by-second/by-ip?page=1&limit=60

###
# By second with ip and time range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/by-second/by-ip?startTime=2025-06-08T00:00:00Z&endTime=2025-06-08T23:59:59Z

### Bulk status updates

###
# Update status to 'IGNORED' for all records with label 'pass'
POST http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/update-status/pass-to-ignored

###
# Update status to 'INREVIEW' for a specific list of records
POST http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/update-status/fail-to-inreview
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "client_ip": "192.168.1.101",
    "timestamp": "20250612100000123456"
  },
  {
    "client_ip": "192.168.1.102",
    "timestamp": "20250612100001234567"
  }
]

### Create quality record with new fields
POST http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_ip": "192.168.1.100",
  "timestamp": "20250612100000123456",
  "label": "fail",
  "confidence": 0.95,
  "object_key": "2024/12/25/14/30/test_001.jpg",
  "error_path": "error/fail/2024/12/25/14/30/test_001.jpg",
  "oss_path": "weixing/error/fail/images/2024/12/25/14/30/test_001.jpg",
  "model_type": "yolo_v8",
  "pc_num": "PC-001",
  "image": "base64_encoded_image_data"
}

### Create quality record with pass label (no error_path)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_ip": "192.168.1.101",
  "timestamp": "20250612100000234567",
  "label": "pass",
  "confidence": 0.98,
  "object_key": "2024/12/25/14/31/test_002.jpg",
  "oss_path": "weixing/pass/images/2024/12/25/14/31/test_002.jpg",
  "model_type": "yolo_v8",
  "pc_num": "PC-002"
}

### Get an image by its filename (object_key)
# @name getImage
# NOTE: Replace the filename with a real one from your database's object_key field
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/images/192.168.1.119_20250613001750616992.jpg

### Review APIs

### Get pending review records
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/pending-review?page=1&limit=20&startTime=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endTime=2024-01-01T23:59:59Z

### Update single record review result
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/192.168.1.100/20250612100000123456/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "review_result": "pass",
  "reviewer": "admin",
  "review_notes": "确认是误报，图片质量正常"
}

### Batch update review results
POST http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/batch-review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "records": [
    {
      "client_ip": "192.168.1.100",
      "timestamp": "20250612100000123456",
      "review_result": "pass"
    },
    {
      "client_ip": "192.168.1.101",
      "timestamp": "20250612100000234567",
      "review_result": "fail"
    }
  ],
  "reviewer": "admin",
  "review_notes": "批量审核备注"
}

### Get false positive rate statistics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/quality-records/stats/false-positive-rate?startTime=2024-01-01T00:00:00Z&endTime=2024-01-31T23:59:59Z&groupBy=day